<title>BELGIUM: No progress reported in Boeing merger case.</title>
<headline>No progress reported in Boeing merger case.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>There is no progress to report on EU investigation of the planned merger between U.S. aerospace Boeing Co and McDonnell Douglas, a European Union source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The situation is still the same,&quot; the source told Reuters.</p>
<p>Martin Craig, Boeing director for communications in Europe, took a similar line. &quot;I don't think there is anything new to report,&quot; Martin said.</p>
<p>The European Commission is set to reject the merger at its meeting on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
</text>
